        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Mul-T-Lock High Security 1-3/8\" Mortise Lock Cylinder</b>\r\n<p>\r\nHigh Security Grade 1 restricted key locks. These 1-3/8\" long mortise lock cylinders can be used on any mortise box that uses a 1-3/8 inch cylinder and a Schlage \"L\" Cam. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Mul-T-Lock 206SP-MOR3C07 1-3/8\" Mortise Lock Cylinder\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Supplied with Security Ring</li>\r\n<li>Drill and Pick Resistance Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Bump Proof Design</li>\r\n<li>Mul-T-Lock 206SP Security Keyway</li>\r\n<li>2 Keys per Lock</li>\r\n<li>Falcon Cam</li>\r\n<li>Standard 1-5/32\" Diameter Lock Housing</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder Length: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>MUL-T-LOCK's Patented Interactive Key Control System</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>MUL-T-LOCK's cylindrical locks are designed to provide superior door protection with uncompromised key control. The Key Card owner is the only person allowed to have the keys duplicated. Saves time and money on future lock replacements or re-keying when employes leave.  Remove the worry about anyone making duplicates of your keys. <b>Keep your doors safe!</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If ordering multiple locks you can have them Key Alike (use the same key) or Keyed Different (different keys for each lock). You can also order <a href=\"/products/cut-keys-for-mul-t-lock-locksets-and-padlocks\">Extra Keys Cut</a> below if more than 2 are required.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "High Security 1-3/8 Inch Mortise Lock Cylinder, Mul-T-Lock 206SP-MOR3C07",
                "description": "High Security Grade 1 restricted key locks. These 1-3/8\" long mortise lock cylinders can be used on any mortise box that uses a 1-3/8 inch cylinder and a Schlage \"L\" Cam.",
                "keywords": "High Security 1-3/8 Inch Mortise Lock Cylinder, Mul-T-Lock 206SP-MOR3C07"
